# Master KPI Framework

## Overview

The Mul Biotech dMRV Platform utilizes a structured Key Performance Indicator (KPI) framework to monitor environmental, agricultural, carbon, biodiversity, water, social, economic, and governance performance across projects.

Current Framework Version: 1.0

Total KPIs: 97

